    "https://www.lynn.edu/career-and-alumni-connections": {
      "title": "Career and Alumni ConnectionsYour guide to career preparation",
      "description": "Career and Alumni Connections | Lynn University Skip directly to page content Disable autoplay of videos Enable autoplay of videos Lynn University Search Menu Home Career and Alumni Connections Career and Alumni Connections Your guide to career preparation Explore Career Connections Alumni at work Employer resources Internships, career preparation and networking Your future is bright Looking for internships, help with your resume, networking opportunities? You've come to the right place. We understand that your career journey is unique, and we're dedicated to providing support tailored to your goals. Our team is committed to helping you unlock your full potential and achieve success in the professional world. Discover a multitude of internship opportunities that align with your passions and field of study. We'll connect you with top companies and organizations, giving you hands-on experience to enhance your skills and build a solid foundation for your future career. Internships, career preparation and networking Our career team helps you land the perfect internship, offers networking opportunities and provides career preparation tools. Handshake Find job and internship opportunities through the No. 1 online job-searching platform for students. Student employment opportunities Current Lynn students can log into Workday to explore and apply for open positions. Alumni connections Support beyond the classroom. Join in the alumni community and connect with your fellow Fighting Knights. Alumni resource hub Catch up with classmates and stay updated on what's happening at Lynn through our alumni resource center. Alumni at work Explore the remarkable career journeys of our alumni and see where a Lynn education has taken them. Alumni benefits As a Lynn graduate, you are connected to a huge network of professional contacts and receive discounts and special offers. Alumni benefits X 10% discount on items at the Schmidt Family Campus Store when you use code ALUMNI10 10% tuition discount on eligible Lynn graduate programs. 10% off your order from Mia Makes Designs when you use LYNN10 15% off at Raise the Bar Menswear when you show your alumni card 20% off products from Lynn Creative Services , including photos, T-shirts and marketing materials 20% discount on cupcakes at Marlee's Bakery and Cupcakery when you use your alumni card (in-store only) 25% off Johnny O's Gymnasium and one free personal training session (show your Lynn Alumni card at sign up) 25% off Pine Tree Camps for children of alumni Access to computers and databases at the Eugene M. and Christine E. Lynn Library (no remote access) Invitations to Celebration of the Arts, Boca Raton Chamber of Commerce's International Business Alliance luncheons and Fighting Knight home games and matches Discounted tuition for eligible children of Lynn alumni Discount on rental rates through Enterprise Rent-A-Car and National Car Rental (contact alumni@lynn.edu to obtain a promo code) room rates at Wyndham Boca Raton (tell the front desk you're a Lynn alumni) services at The Picnic Creative; let Erica know you're an alumni Notary and witness services Use of InterviewStream, mock interview technology If you’d like to see a new service added or contribute your own, contact the Alumni Connections team . See benefits Upcoming events Career fairs, preperation workshops, recruiting sessions and more ... Tuesday, Sep. 8, 2026 , 11 a.m. EDT Meet Boys & Girls Club of Palm Beach County Wednesday, Sep. 9, 2026 , 10:30 a.m. Resume walk-in hours Tuesday, Sep. 29, 2026 , 11 a.m. EDT Meet Enterprise Mobility Tabling Tuesday Wednesday, Sep. 30 , 10:30 a.m. – 12:30 p.m. EDT Internship Fair Reserve your table Tuesday, Oct. 6, 2026 , 11 a.m. EDT Meet Space of Mind Employer resources Connect with us to recruit our students for internship and employment opportunities that align with your needs. Partner with us Additional student resources From accessibility services to career updates, we're here to help you thrive. Career connections directory We're here for you! Stop by our office in the university center or call to make an appointment. Stay up to date Follow us on Instagram to see upcoming career events to help you hone your skills, and see what your peers are up to. Student Accessibility Services Support for your success. We're committed to an accessible experience for every student. Career and Alumni Connections FAQs What services does Career and Alumni Connections offer? The department provides students with resources to reach their full potential, including career counseling, career fairs, networking events, internship opportunities, resume and interview support and professional development resources. How can students make an appointment with Career and Alumni Connections? Students can find more information on booking appointments for resume reviews, interview preparation or internship and career guidance through Knowledge Base, ensuring personalized support. What resources are available for internships and jobs? Students can access opportunities through career fairs, employer recruiting sessions, student employment opportunities through Workday and career preparation platform tools, Handshake and CareerShift. How does Lynn support alumni? Alumni are encouraged to connect with their fellow Fighting Knights through alumni resources, networking opportunities and alumni events to maintain lifelong connections. What resources are available for employers? Employees can partner with Lynn to recruit students and alumni for internships and employment opportunities. Contact Career and Alumni Connections Phone number +1 561-237-7286 Career Connections Email: careerconnections@lynn.edu Facebook Instagram Alumni Email: alumni@lynn.edu Facebook Twitter Instagram LinkedIn Office hours Monday–Friday: 9 a.m.–5 p.m. About Academics Admission & aid Student life Giving Accreditation Employment Accessibility University policies and bylaws Lynn University 3601 N. Military Trail Boca Raton, FL 33431 +1 561-237-7000 1-800-994-LYNN Contact us Map & directions Facebook Twitter Instagram YouTube LinkedIn Copyright © 2026 Lynn University. All rights reserved. Terms of use Privacy statement Consumer disclosures Ethics hotline EASE grant performance measures Search Go Popular topics Degree programs (majors & minors) Tuition, scholarships and financial aid Academic calendar Jobs, employment opportunities Transcript request About menu button trigger About Mission & strategy Location Lynn history Lynn facts Awards Leadership Employment Lynn traditions Academics menu button trigger Academics Areas of study Individualized learning Colleges Academic calendar Academic catalog Prior academic credits Core curriculum Admission menu button trigger Admission Apply to Lynn Visit Lynn Tuition & aid Student life menu button trigger Student life Campus safety Dining Health & wellness Housing Transportation Clubs & organizations Giving menu button trigger Giving Support arts & culture Support athletics Support academics Support campus Annual giving Ways to give Athletics Campus directory Campus store Career and Alumni Connections Events Library Map & directions OneCampus News Alumni Education counselors & consultants Employees Students Parents and families Partners and community"
